01:47:03.973 --> 01:47:05.208 size:53% position:73% line:71%
THAT.

01:47:04.274 --> 01:47:06.309 size:53% position:73% line:71%
I DON'T THINK I COULD'VE GOT MY

01:47:05.342 --> 01:47:10.347 size:53% position:73% line:71%
