YOU SAY AS A STAFF, WE HAVE TO

01:47:43.046 --> 01:47:45.382 size:53% position:73% line:71%
TAKE IT UPON OURSELVES TO GO OUT

01:47:43.813 --> 01:47:45.949 size:53% position:73% line:71%
